## This phase of the project

The product is live at https://sljakam.com without real users yet. Work is
organised in phases in `PROGRESS.md` (A safety, B core loop, C hardening, …).
Each finished phase is shipped: whole-repo check + e2e green, PR, CI green,
merge, deploy, verify on the live site.

## Cursor notes

- Read `PROGRESS.md` at the start of a chat. Don't edit files in a phase that
  Claude Code currently owns (recorded in `PROGRESS.md`).
- Best for focused tasks inside a phase: in-editor edits, UI fine-tuning,
  small fixes. For anything touching more than ~3 files, a new dependency or
  a schema change, propose options and wait.
- UI tweaks: change only the listed values, and name the exact classes/tokens
  before editing.
- Before saying "done": run the whole-repo check from AGENTS.md and show the
  output.

## Scope

Only change what the task asks. If something else should change, say so —
don't do it silently.

